             [--aammqq] _p_a_t_h
             Force an error into the metadnode for a file or directory.

      zziinnjjeecctt --tt _m_o_s___t_y_p_e --CC _d_v_a_s [--ee _d_e_v_i_c_e___e_r_r_o_r] [--ff _f_r_e_q_u_e_n_c_y] [--ll _l_e_v_e_l]
